{
  "request": "sp and mp don't react the same in the score studio. for some reason, sp starts at -10 instead of 0; when I make something 0 costing, it makes it -10. I can't set my damage below certain numbers at times. (Owner chose A: the damage box sets the card's own number before the hero's bonus, so 0 and 1 always work; the card face still shows the hero's total.)",
